   "spoken": "Here's the key idea of the system: the knight to h6, not a natural square until you see the plan — it's heading straight for f5 to pile another attacker onto d4.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "...Nh6-f5 reroutes the knight to hammer d4"
