   "line": [
    "Bxh6",
    "gxh6"
   ],
   "spoken": "If White grabs the knight on h6, Black recaptures with the g-pawn and welcomes it: the doubled h-pawns are nothing next to the open g-file, the bishop coming to g7, and a quick f6 break — massive kingside play for the taking.",
   "kind": "main",
