   "line": [
    "Be2",
    "Bg7"
   ],
   "spoken": "The main move is the quiet bishop to e2. Black fianchettoes to g7 — it looks blunted by its own e5-pawn wall, but that bishop springs to life the moment f6 cracks the centre open.",
